			"notes": {
				"rationale": "viel here is used adverbially, modifying the verb ('often, a lot', DWDS viel II.1 adverbiell 'häufig, oft': viel lachen, wandern), so it is the comparable ADV viel, whose Cmp and Sup are mehr and am meisten (de/quantifier-by-use). Ruled on #743 (SZ-B6, SZ-A4, A3). viel spazieren is DWDS viel II.1 'häufig, oft', merged with es regnete viel 'a lot' into one Reading under ADR 0031."
